values ('d8e9f0a1-2b3c-4e37-8a67-7b8c9d0e1f77', 'introduction-to-literary-studies', 'Introduction to Literary Studies', 'Introduce literature as an object of close attention, historical inquiry, interpretation, argument, and scholarly conversation. Topics cover close reading, literary terms and critical vocabulary, poetry, fiction and narrative technique, drama and performance, genre and convention, literary periods and historical context, book history and material texts, introductory theory, world literature and translation, canon and representation, secondary sources, literary analysis essays, MLA citation and scholarly practice, and a close reading portfolio.');

